ame=\"average trade value\">\n                    $321.33\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"average trade description\">\n                    Mean performance across all logged trades\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ledger-panel border-emerald-400/35 bg-emerald-400/[0.055] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"best trade summary card\">\n                <p class=\"ledger-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"best trade label\">\n                    Best trade\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"best trade value\">\n                    TSLA · $620.00\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"best trade timestamp\">\n                    Sep 3, 2026, 2:42 PM\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ledger-panel border-rose-400/35 bg-rose-400/[0.055] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"worst trade summary card\">\n                <p class=\"ledger-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"worst trade label\">\n                    Worst trade\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"worst trade value\">\n                    NVDA · -$168.00\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-3\" data-name=\"worst trade timestamp\">\n                    Sep 5, 2026, 10:05 AM\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <div class=\"mb-8 grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-[1.1fr_2fr]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4\" data-name=\"trade management section\">\n            <section class=\"ledger-panel p-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"record trade panel\">\n                <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"